That's enough. Cut her some slack.

204
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,500
Let the poor girl finish work so she can go home.

205
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:36,500
By the way, honey, I know I suggested you block your mom on Moments.

206
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:38,500
So why'd you block me instead?

207
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:42,500
Oh, uh, that was an accident.

208
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:46,500
Your mom won't be so fussy if she doesn't see pictures like that.

209
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:48,500
