265
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:45,100
I dreamt I was eating spring rolls with my parents.

266
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,280
Folks on your mind?

267
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,580
Yeah, and they're on hers as well.

268
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,620
When you became her,

269
00:12:55,300 --> 00:12:57,740
you took on some of her feelings and memories

270
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:58,740
and must be tough.

271
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,640
I wonder if they'll come back.

272
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,080
It'll work out. Just rest.

273
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,200
